0497                         *                 (A) = ' '
0498                         *        USES:    A,X
0499                         
0500 fd7a 8d 13              OUT4HS BSR    THB
0501                         
0502                         **     OUT2HS - OUTPUT TWO HEX DIGITS AND SPACE
0503                         
0504 fd7c 8d 11              OUT2HS BSR    THB
0505                         
