0533                         *
0534                         *        ENTRY: (B) = CHECKSUM
0535                         *               (X) = ADDRESS
0536                         *
0537                         *        EXIT:  X INCREMENTED; CHECKSUM UPDATED
0538                         *
0539                         *        USES:  A,B,C,X
0540                         
0541 fd8d eb 00              PUNT2  ADDB   0,X      UPDATE CHECKSUM
0542                         
